            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We present a case of a 70 year-old female with severe aortic stenosis, multivessel coronary artery disease and breast cancer who successfully underwent complex percutaneous coronary revascularisation, transapical aortic valve implantation and mastectomy.</AbstractText>
